%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/processor_test.clj:706 (parse-transform-with-header-functions-test)
testing: Parse transform with var directive
元の形: DW スクリプト
元テストは parse だけで評価していない
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
var greeting = "Hello"
var count = 10
---
{
  message: greeting,
  total: count * 2
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "message": "Hello",
  "total": 20
}
